<title>UK: Hickson year pretax rises before charges.</title>
<headline>Hickson year pretax rises before charges.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		  4.1		  vs  3.3</p>
<p> Pretax			 7.8		  vs  5.9</p>
<p> Turnover		   322.8		  vs 383.7</p>
<p>NOTE - The pretax profits are before taking into account preexceptional expenses of 17.0 million stg in 1996 and 50.9 million stg in 1995. After charges, Hickson International Plc posted a pretax loss of 9.2 million stg in 1996 versus a loss of 45.0 million stg.</p>
<p>Earnings per share after charges was a loss of 5.6p versus a loss of 25.6p.</p>
<p>The company said it would not recommend paying a dividend at this time.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542-7717</p>
